{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号米白色粗体文字，字号最大、对比度高，且位于屏幕上半部最先进入视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他暂时不想考虑两个人的未来，只想留在当下的亲近之中。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、放松、陶醉、眷恋。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他后来忽然想告诉对方自己有多喜欢这种相处，也想知道对方是否有同样的感受，但还没想好怎么开口，念头就淡了。右上角的阶段目录也不容易第一眼读到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块字号和亮度相近的大号文字争夺主视线，第一块之后，第二块也会吸引注意力。\",\n    \"下方两行辅助短语各自连续排列多个意思，需要进一步挑选和辨认。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d73e6ce3-40da-4e42-b873-e09800a2696a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T030916267230Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:09:36.782430+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "300e5d1655cc899f7335b27822b650f1266042e264e28939390fcbb44783ad8a", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388500002